      "writtenOn": "2021-10-04T23:33:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "period is the total of on_sec + off_sec. I was missing on_sec field which I added.\nLets say on_sec \u003d 2, off_sec \u003d 2.\nPeriod will be 4 (2 + 2)\n\nThe logic is (battery_ticks % period \u003c on_sec)\n\nSo for battery ticks:\n0 , 1 (0 % 4, 1 % 4 \u003c 2) -\u003e led on, \n2, 3 (2 % 4, 3 % 4 \u003e\u003d 2) -\u003e led off\n4, 5 led on, 6, 7 led off and so on.\n\nIt could be LED_COLOR and LED_OFF or it could be color_1 and color_2\nEg. 2 sec Amber, 2 sec Blue. So I have color_1 and color_2 fields",
      "parentUuid": "8971b437_30b7617f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
