      "message": "Using the option 3 is the right way. I guess you miss the `;`. Should be:\n\nCODE_COND_1(DT_NODE_EXISTS(DT_CHILD(id, color_2), \n            (led_values[CHARGE_STATE(id)][CHIPSET_STATE(id)].color_2 \u003d \n            COLOR(id, color_2);), \n            ())\n\nAs the else condition is empty, you can simply use IF_ENABLED() instead.",
